<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/morphoeval-delphi10000-clytia-hemisphaerica-turing-wavelength-s0> a pk:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "Clytia hemisphaerica Schnakenberg wavelength at 8.64 µm (Pass 2) (Clytia hemisphaerica)",
        "Clytia hemisphaerica Schnakenberg wavelength at 8.64 µm (Pass 2) faithfully reproduces Clytia hemisphaerica morphology" ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/delphi10000-clytia-hemisphaerica-turing-wavelength-s0-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/delphi10000-clytia-hemisphaerica-turing-wavelength-s0-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/delphi10000-clytia-hemisphaerica-turing-wavelength-s0-3>,
